  "nih-summer": { deadline: "2027-01-26", opensAt: "2026-10-13", blurb: "Paid summer research placement in the NIH Intramural Research Program. Graduating seniors qualify only if they turn 17 by June 1 and 18 by September 30 of the programme year, live within 40 miles of an NIH campus, and will have graduated before the internship starts. U.S. citizens and permanent residents only.", verified: true, evidence: "Reinstated 2026-09-21 after re-reading the official page. The September 16 removal rested on the banner This program is available to: College Students or Recent College Graduates, but the eligibility criteria carve out graduating seniors: you must be 18 years old by September 30, 2027; if you are a graduating high school senior who will be 17 years old as of June 1, 2027 but will turn 18 by September 30, 2027, your permanent home address must be located within 40 miles of an NIH campus. AND one of the following: enrolled at least half-time as a senior in high school at the time of application and have graduated high school before the start of the internship. The SIP 2027 application will open on Tuesday, October 13 at 9 am ET and close on Tuesday, January 26, 2027 at 12 pm (noon) ET. | Earlier this run: 2026-09-16: NIH Summer Internship Program page: This program is available to: College Students or Recent College Graduates; eligibility for Summer 2027 requires college, graduate or professional school enrollment. | Sept 15: 2026-03-01 was a past cycle's deadline and the official page (checked 2026-09-15) posts no later date." },
