  "university-of-wyoming-summer-high-school-institute": { deadline: "2027-02-07", opensAt: "2026-10-01", blurb: "Three-week residential institute at the University of Wyoming for the state's high school sophomores, built around ungraded seminar classes. Applications for the 2027 institute open on October 1, 2026 and all pieces, including a counsellor-uploaded transcript, are due by February 7, 2027.", verified: true, evidence: "Official pages: Applications for HSI 2027 will open October 1. HSI Application pieces are due by February 7, 2027. HSI provides an immersive, intellectually vibrant community where Wyoming's most promising high school sophomores can explore ideas. High school counselors will upload the students transcript using the link below." },
  "university-of-mississippi-rebel-research-scholars": { blurb: "Summer research experience at the University of Mississippi where high school students join faculty-led projects while living on campus alongside the Summer College for High School Students cohort. Merit and need-based aid is available through the application portal.", category: "Research", verified: true, evidence: "Official page fetched and corroborated 2026-09-26 (HTTP 200). Eligibility wording on the page: 'ost Experience Log In Rebel Research Scholars Summer Research Experience a Summer College Program R ebel Research Scholars offers high school students hands-on, faculty-led research experiences, providing a unique opportunity to explore future careers.'. The page also describes the programme: 'es Academics Admissions Cost Experience Log In Rebel Research Scholars Summer Research Experience a Summer College Program R ebel Research Scholars offers high school students hands-on, faculty-led research experiences, providing a unique opportunity to explore future careers.'. 100% of the listing's title terms and 100% of its organisation terms appear in the page text. This confirms the link resolves to a live page about this programme that is open to high schoolers. It is not a field-by-field audit of cost, grades or dates. | Earlier this run: Official page: Rebel Research Scholars offers high school students hands-on, faculty-led research experiences, providing a unique opportunity to explore future careers. Outside of research, students will experience campus life alongside peers in the Summer College for High School Students (SCHS) program. Students may qualify for scholarships based on academic merit as well as financial need. The listing was categorised as an internship; it is a mentored research experience." },
